{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"555e31ae76b46550a3b743147e15fb3c1cb2dc35e9791975293bafdfcec4d774","digest":{"component_or_area":"code review impact model (decide.py, verify.py)","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/decide.py","src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/verify.py","src/rebar/llm/reviewers/code-review-verify.md","src/rebar/llm/code_review/sidecar.py","tests/unit/test_impact_model_versioning.py","tests/unit/fixtures/code_review_impact_labels.jsonl","tests/unit/test_impact_code.py","_CODE_MAINT_BINARIES","reachable_path_without_automated_coverage","IMPACT_MODEL_VERSION","CodeSeverityAttrs"],"problem_keywords":["untested degradation","unmasked regression","reachable path without coverage","impact model vocabulary gap","zero-scored finding"],"propositions":["Change #529 introduced a reachable code path with no automated test coverage but was scored impact 0.0 by the pass-2 impact model, resulting in a red-main regression 57 minutes post-merge.","The impact_code pass-2 vocabulary lacks a consequence binary to express 'change introduces or unmasks a reachable path with no automated coverage'; severity none/impact 0.0 cannot be overridden.","A new maintainability-lane consequence binary `reachable_path_without_automated_coverage` (bool, tier moderate 0.6) must be added to decide.py's `_CODE_MAINT_BINARIES` and the verify.py severity model to enable non-zero impact scoring for untested-degradation findings.","IMPACT_MODEL_VERSION must be bumped from code-v2 to code-v3 per ADR 0036 to gate consumption of the new binary, and version-pinning tests must be updated accordingly.","The new binary and model version must be validated by replaying #529-shaped findings through the extended model and exercising the binary in labeled test fixtures to ensure impact > 0 under code-v3 while preserving backward compatibility for code-v2 sidecars."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785825452555212414,"uuid":"f50920de-df35-4d76-8875-f68ca66cc35e"}